OL,3,GNEWSACouncil dropped initial
OL,4,Ainvestigation into sex abuse teacher
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has launched an investigation
OL,7,Finto how it handled sex assault
OL,8,Fallegations against a teacher later
OL,9,Ffound to have abused 12 boys.
OL,11,FThe probe will examine why police were
OL,12,Fnot called in after it emerged
OL,13,Fcomputing teacher Martin Gallacher had
OL,14,Fassaulted a teenager at a school in
OL,15,FPaisley.
OL,17,FThe boy told the school what had
OL,18,Fhappened to him in 2024 but an internal
OL,19,Finvestigation was dropped due to
OL,20,F"insufficient evidence".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
